Kevin name and character license

The code in this repository may be read, copied and changed. The name "Kevin" as used for this character, the name
"Kevin the NPC", the "Original Kevin" stamp and Kevin's look (the cartoon head in front of a record, the marigold
sleeve, the KEVIN · NPC tag) may be used only by a bot that runs Kevin's Charter (CHARTER.md) whole and unmodified,
every rule, and says so with a link to the charter.

A bot that drops, edits or works around any rule of the charter is not Kevin. It may not use the name, the look or the
stamp, and it may not say or suggest that it is Kevin, comes from Kevin, or is related to roastedbykevin.com.

Anyone can check a Kevin: the real one lives only at https://roastedbykevin.com, and its charter's SHA-256 is shown at
https://roastedbykevin.com/charter. Anyone can build their own bot; only one that keeps the charter whole may be called
Kevin (charter rule 14).
